@choice break-leave "Leave school" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

@elseif school.phase == "after_school"

Lessons are over, but {{place.name}} remains open until 17:00.

@choice after-school-wait "Stay until school closes" -> place.high-school
  @icon ⏳
  @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
@endchoice

@choice after-school-leave "Leave school" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

@elseif school.phase == "no_school"

There are no lessons today, though the administrative areas remain open.

@choice no-school-office "Visit the school office" -> place.high-school
  @icon 🏫
  @time 15m
@endchoice

@choice no-school-notices "Read the school notices" -> place.high-school
  @icon 📌
  @time 5m
@endchoice

@choice no-school-leave "Leave" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
  @time 1m
@endchoice

@else

The school has closed for the day.

@choice closed-leave "Step outside" -> @leave-place
  @icon 🚪
@endchoice

@endif

